                                "sense_id": "747d5b0f-fe2d-3f51-9af8-a1e4e9e081bb",
                                "text": "The goal — what Dash considers to be the mastery of aquaphobia — is to float peacefully in deep water for at least five minutes, 10 feet from a wall or support."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
